Electrons are moving in a vacuum with speed $1.7 \times 10^7 \text{ m s}^{-1}$. The electrons enter a uniform magnetic field of flux density $4.8\text{ mT}$. Fig. 6.1 shows the path of the electrons.

{{figure:figure_6_1}}

The path of the electrons remains in the plane of the page.

